      "created_at": "2015-09-07T12:22:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm not sure when oversized villain cards will be back. &nbsp; The preorder page for Villains of the Multiverse does state this:</p><p>\n&gt; </p><p><strong>Additional Bonus!</strong><span>&nbsp;Every preorder of&nbsp;</span><strong>Villains of the Multiverse</strong><span>&nbsp;comes with three art prints and 7 promo cards. More info to come on all of those promos!</span></p><p><span>\n</span></p><p>So while it will net you the promo hero cards you will still have to separately preorder Chokepoint and Celestrial Tribunal as well if you want those. &nbsp;</p>",
